# Copy this file to automation/.env (gitignored, never commit the real one).

# From upload-post.com dashboard -> API Keys. TikTok posting needs their paid Basic plan
# ($24/mo minimum, verified 2026-08-10) - do not sign up for that until Track A is close to
# Day 1, see docs/WARM-UP.md. The free tier works for testing --dry-run without a key at all.
UPLOAD_POST_KEY=

# The profile name you create in upload-post.com's dashboard (User Management) and connect
# your TikTok account to via their OAuth flow. Can also be passed per-command with --profile.
UPLOAD_POST_PROFILE=

# Higgsfield (AI b-roll, `node cli.js video`). A TWO-part credential: the API sends them as
# `Authorization: Key <KEY_ID>:<KEY_SECRET>`, NOT as a single bearer token. Generate both in the
# Higgsfield platform dashboard. Verified 2026-08-13.
#
# THIS ONE COSTS REAL MONEY. Higgsfield is paid: ~$15/mo cheapest tier, top-ups ~$5 per 100 credits,
# 15-25 credits per basic video. Every call is founder money against the $100 cap, so it needs
# explicit approval like any other spend. `--dry-run` works with no key and spends nothing.
# Sanctioned use is narrow: abstract b-roll only (water, light, texture, motion). The CLI refuses to
# generate cats, pets, people or the product. Anything it makes carries TikTok's AIGC label.
HF_API_KEY=
HF_API_SECRET=

# ElevenLabs (narration audio, `node cli.js voice`). Sent as the `xi-api-key` header, NOT a bearer
# token. Verified 2026-08-13.
#
# READ BEFORE USING: their FREE tier is personal, NON-COMMERCIAL and requires attribution to
# ElevenLabs. This store's content is commercial marketing, so free-tier audio may NOT be used in
# it. Commercial rights start on their paid plans. The CLI refuses a real run unless you pass
# --commercial-confirmed, which is you asserting a paid plan exists.
#
# Free alternative that is usually the better default: TikTok's own built-in text-to-speech. Free,
# native, no key, no subscription, applied in the TikTok or CapCut editor. For a short text-card
# video it does the same job. Use ElevenLabs when voice quality is specifically the point.
ELEVENLABS_KEY=
